    "en": {
      "trackName": "Wrist Survivors",
      "description": "Hell has floors. You have a wrist. Wrist Survivors is a full survivors-like arcade game built entirely for Apple Watch - descend through the biomes of the underworld, mow down hordes of monsters, and see how deep you can go before hell takes you back.\n\nEvery run is fast, brutal, and fits in a queue: joystick or gyroscope controls, auto-attacking weapons, and upgrade choices that stack into ridiculous builds. Slay your way past the bosses sealing each floor, loot shrines, and unlock permanent upgrades between runs.\n\nFEATURES\n- True survivors-like gameplay on your wrist - no iPhone required\n- The Descent: floor-based biomes with bosses guarding the way down\n- 10 enemy archetypes and ever-nastier attack patterns\n- Build variety: stack upgrades into your own flavor of overkill\n- Joystick or gyroscope controls - play with a tilt of the wrist\n- Runs measured in seconds, sessions measured in \"one more floor\"\n- Metal attitude, gothic style, and humor your mother would not approve of\n\nYour first run is free. One payment unlocks the full game forever - no subscriptions, no ads, no energy timers.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wrist-survivors/id6793478793?uo=4",
